Z||000001||Standard||08-28-2000||04:26 PM||||The factory sunroof takes up just about the whole roof.  <P>Look at your RPO sheet, it will be a sheet of laminated paper on the drivers side with a bunch of 3 letter/number codes on it.  If you have a factory sunroof the code AD3 should be on there.<P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 149,000 miles and counting!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">   <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker||||reg||1
